{"seq":1,"slug":"combo-system","title":"连招系统：把攻击编织成乐句","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/flow/combo-system","wordCount":1494,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"连招系统-把攻击编织成乐句\">连招系统：把攻击编织成乐句</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>连招系统是把单次攻击组织成序列的结构层：招式之间通过<strong>衔接类型</strong>（取消、目押、系统兜底）链接，用<strong>浮空与追击</strong>延长连段，再以<strong>伤害递减</strong>给连段封顶，避免无限连。它是近战深度支柱的主要载体——玩家钻研的多是连段路线而非单招。让连招&quot;能接上&quot;的取消与缓冲机制是下一篇 <a href=\"cancels-buffering\">取消与输入缓冲</a> 的主题，本篇聚焦连招的组织与设计。</p>\n<p>单次攻击是词，连招是句子。近战的深度支柱几乎全部承载在连招上——玩家在第 50 小时仍在钻研的，往往不是某一招而是某条连段路线。本篇讲连招的结构：招式如何链接、哪些接法靠系统兜底哪些靠玩家手速、浮空追击如何延长连段、以及为什么必须有伤害递减来给连段封顶。让连招&quot;能接上&quot;的取消与缓冲机制是下一篇 <a href=\"cancels-buffering\">取消与输入缓冲</a> 的主题，本篇聚焦连招的组织与设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连招的三种衔接类型\">连招的三种衔接类型</h2><p>连招把一招接到下一招，衔接方式按&quot;系统宽容度&quot;分三类，从松到紧：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>玩家难度</th>\n<th>典型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目标连 chain / gatling</td>\n<td>系统允许在攻击中直接按下一招取消过去</td>\n<td>低，几乎必接</td>\n<td>街霸的轻→中→重目押链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目押 link</td>\n<td>上招完全恢复后、下招起手前的窄窗口内衔接</td>\n<td>高，看帧优势</td>\n<td>需要正优势的招接招</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派生 route</td>\n<td>按方向+键触发招式的分支树</td>\n<td>中，靠记忆</td>\n<td>鬼泣的招式树</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>目标连靠取消，系统主动帮你把两招粘起来；目押靠帧优势，上招留下的正优势帧数（见 <a href=\"../hitreg/active-frames\">起手/判定/收招帧</a> 的帧优势公式）必须大于下招起手，玩家还得卡在那几帧内输入。一段设计良好的连招通常混用三者：前段用宽容的目标连保证人人能起手，后段用目押和派生拉开高手与新手的差距，这正是深度支柱&quot;基础连段人人可用、高阶路线留给钻研者&quot;的分层落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"浮空与追击\">浮空与追击</h2><p>把敌人打上天再空中追打（juggle），是延长连段、制造华丽感的主力手段。它的关键量是浮空状态下的重力与击飞速度。敌人被挑击赋予一个向上初速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，随后受重力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 减速下落，滞空时间约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>air</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{air}} = \\frac{2 v_0}{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">air</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>滞空时间决定了追击窗口有多长。设计上通过两个旋钮控制浮空连段不至于无限：一是每次空中命中施加<strong>递减的上抛力</strong>，让敌人越打越接近地面；二是设<strong>浮空硬直上限</strong>，超过后敌人强制受身（recovery）脱离连段。下图是一段浮空连的状态流转：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    G[地面连段] --&gt;|挑击 launcher| L[浮空上升&lt;br/&gt;v0 向上]&#10;    L --&gt; A1[空中攻击1&lt;br/&gt;补上抛,重置硬直]&#10;    A1 --&gt; A2[空中攻击2&lt;br/&gt;上抛递减]&#10;    A2 --&gt; A3[空中攻击3&lt;br/&gt;上抛更弱]&#10;    A3 --&gt;|超浮空上限或硬直断| F[击落/受身]&#10;    F --&gt;|落地| G&#10;    A2 -.收招取消.-&gt; DASH[空中冲刺延续]\">graph TD\n    G[地面连段] --&gt;|挑击 launcher| L[浮空上升&lt;br/&gt;v0 向上]\n    L --&gt; A1[空中攻击1&lt;br/&gt;补上抛,重置硬直]\n    A1 --&gt; A2[空中攻击2&lt;br/&gt;上抛递减]\n    A2 --&gt; A3[空中攻击3&lt;br/&gt;上抛更弱]\n    A3 --&gt;|超浮空上限或硬直断| F[击落/受身]\n    F --&gt;|落地| G\n    A2 -.收招取消.-&gt; DASH[空中冲刺延续]</pre><p>浮空追击对判定提出额外要求：空中的受击框往往与站立不同，且追击招需要能打到不断变化的高度——这回到 <a href=\"../hitreg/hitbox-hurtbox\">攻击框与受击框</a> 里框随姿态变化的设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"伤害递减-给连段封顶\">伤害递减：给连段封顶</h2><p>如果连段越长每下伤害不变，那么能连得越久的招式组合就会碾压一切，系统失衡。几乎所有有深度连招的游戏都引入<strong>伤害递减（damage scaling / proration）</strong>：连段中第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 段的实际伤害按一个随段数下降的比例系数缩放。一种常见模型是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_n = D_{\\text{base}} \\times s_n, \\quad s_n = \\max(s_{\\min},\\ 1 - (n-1)\\cdot k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 段的缩放系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是每段递减步长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是缩放下限（避免长连段的每下伤害趋近于零）。有的系统还让起手招本身携带一个&quot;初始 proration&quot;，用威力大的起手换取整段的低缩放，反之亦然——这本身就是一层博弈：追求华丽长连还是追求高效短连。</p>\n<p>伤害递减的意义不只是平衡数值，更是<strong>鼓励多样性</strong>：它让&quot;一套无脑最优连段打到死&quot;不划算，逼玩家根据局势在快连、稳连、高伤连之间选择。这层设计意图与整体平衡框架相关，具体的数值平衡方法见跨库的 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/systems-depth/combo-system-design\">战斗系统设计 · 连招系统设计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连段的数据表示\">连段的数据表示</h2><p>从工程看，一段进行中的连招是一个<strong>连段上下文（combo context）</strong>：记录当前段数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、累计伤害、当前缩放系数、上一招是什么（用于合法性校验）、以及连段计时器（超时未接则连段结束、缩放复位）。每次成功命中推进上下文；一旦目标脱离硬直或计时器超时，上下文清空、缩放复位。把连段做成显式上下文而非隐式状态，好处是易于展示连段计数 UI、易于调试&quot;这段为什么断了&quot;、也易于遥测统计玩家实际打出的连段分布，为 <a href=\"../practice/melee-tuning\">手感调校</a> 提供数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>连招衔接分目标连（靠取消，宽容）、目押（靠帧优势，苛刻）、派生（靠招式树记忆），良好连招分层混用三者。</li>\n<li>浮空追击用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>air</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{air}} = 2v_0/g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">air</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 决定滞空窗口，靠递减上抛力与浮空硬直上限防止无限连。</li>\n<li>伤害递减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_n = D_{\\text{base}}\\cdot s_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 给连段封顶，核心目的是鼓励连段多样性而非单一最优解。</li>\n<li>一段连招在工程上是显式的连段上下文（段数、缩放、上一招、计时器），便于 UI、调试与遥测。</li>\n<li>连招是深度支柱的主要载体，把离散招式编织成有风险回报的战斗乐句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>让连招接得上的机制：<a href=\"cancels-buffering\">取消与输入缓冲</a></li>\n<li>连招节奏依赖的命中冻结：<a href=\"hitstop-feedback\">硬直与打击感</a></li>\n<li>跨库：连招的平衡与数值设计 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/systems-depth/combo-system-design\">战斗系统设计 · 连招系统设计</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"连招系统：把攻击编织成乐句","id":"连招系统-把攻击编织成乐句"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"连招的三种衔接类型","id":"连招的三种衔接类型"},{"level":2,"text":"浮空与追击","id":"浮空与追击"},{"level":2,"text":"伤害递减：给连段封顶","id":"伤害递减-给连段封顶"},{"level":2,"text":"连段的数据表示","id":"连段的数据表示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"命中检测：扫掠、多段与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/hitreg/hit-detection"},"next":{"title":"取消与输入缓冲：跟手感从哪里来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-melee-combat-systems/flow/cancels-buffering"}}